Deterministic release research for /steward:update, with a persistence layer. Fetches the GitHub CHANGELOG.md, Anthropic's published changelog (the only source carrying a date for every version), the Releases API and GitHub issue search; merges them into a store that keeps immutable facts forever and expires only open-issue data; classifies risk from the clock at run time; and keeps an append-only log of what the operator chose and why. Store lives in the vault when there is one, so a second machine inherits the history.
